              "help": {
                "text": "Coverage of Dangerous sink usage (eval, system, exec, proc_open, unserialize, file writes, raw SQL) across the assessed attack surface.",
                "markdown": "Coverage of Dangerous sink usage (eval, system, exec, proc_open, unserialize, file writes, raw SQL) across the assessed attack surface."
