          "ruleIndex": 33,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Installer lock bypass / pre-provisioning unauthenticated takeover — Ruled out: Installer lock logic (InstallerService::isInstalled, acquireInstallLock, EnsureAppIsInstalled middleware)\n\nisAlreadyProvisioned() = storage/installed file OR (users table + instructor exists); flock(storage/installing.lock, LOCK_EX|LOCK_NB) serializes concurrent installs and re-checks the lock inside performInstall; EnsureAppIsInstalled middleware heals a deleted lock file from DB state and blocks /install* (verified live: GET /install → 302, POST test-db → 403, POST /install → 403 after lock deletion with instructor present). createInstructor() refuses to touch existing username/email (anti-re-open ATO). InstallerTest 18/18 pass."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "Installer lock logic (InstallerService::isInstalled, acquireInstallLock, EnsureAppIsInstalled middleware)"
                }
