        {
          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/env-injection-newline-injection-of-arbitrary-env-vars-app-debug-flip-cache-driver-change",
          "ruleIndex": 34,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": ".env injection / newline injection of arbitrary env vars (APP_DEBUG flip, cache driver change) — Ruled out: .env writer (InstallerService::updateEnv/formatEnvValue, updateDatabaseEnv, updateAppUrl)\n\nDynamically tested the vendored phpdotenv parser (vendor/vlucas/phpdotenv): newlines inside quoted values are re-joined by the multiline processor, so \"DB_PASSWORD=x\\nAPP_DEBUG=true\" stays one value and cannot inject new variables; formatEnvValue's addcslashes escapes quotes/backslashes/$; lone trailing backslash doesn't swallow following lines. Both append and preg_replace update paths tested. No APP_DEBUG/APP_KEY/SESSION_DRIVER flip, no code-exec path."
          },
          "locations": [
