          "message": {
            "text": "Business logic (workflow bypass, state manipulation, multi-step flows: submissions/grading, progress, queue broadcast, sandbox reset, spectate) — No issue identified: Instructor/training workflow surfaces (submissions, progress, queue broadcast, sandbox reset, spectate) — business logic\n\nBusiness-logic boundaries were assessed by the IDOR & Objectz lane (completed 16:57): saveProgress re-verifies objectives server-side against the caller's own terminal logs (no trust-the-client grading); submissions/grading flow instructor-gated with office scoping; queue broadcast and sandbox reset verified office-scoped except two same-trust-tier residuals noted but not reported — (1) spectate lookup has no role filter so same-office instructors can view each other's terminal history, (2) same-office sandbox reset clears queue items created by other same-office instructors. Both are role-consistent within a single-academy trust model; no cross-tier impact demonstrated. Root recording on the lane's behalf to close the ledger."
