          "message": {
            "text": "Information disclosure (error messages, debug endpoints, metadata leakage via installer responses) — No issue identified: Installer responses (/install/requirements JSON, test-db error messages, lock-state behavior, CLI artifacts) — information disclosure\n\nInformation disclosure on the installer surface was assessed by the Installer lane (completed 17:20): /install/requirements returns generic environment booleans; test-db error responses are deliberately generic (no reachability-oracle detail, no version strings — confirmed live); requirements/test-db/install all re-check isAlreadyProvisioned() and 403/redirect when locked; CLI installer leaves no lock mismatch (lock self-heals from instructor-exists fallback, verified live). The Host-header prefill of the wizard's default app_url was checked for JS-string breakout and did not break out ({{ }} encoding) — covered by entry 54d25e. Timing-oracle disclosure is the informational component of vuln-0008. Root recording on the lane's behalf to close the ledger."
